ded when included in the project scope."],["What information should I upload with the RFQ?","Upload the latest one-line diagram, load schedule, utility correspondence, breaker specifications, site photos, installation requirements, delivery date, and any project notes. If you only have part of this information, that is still enough to start the review."],["How does IndustLabs reduce project risk?","We review the electrical requirements, physical constraints, approval path, documentation needs, breaker platform, testing expectations, and field conditions before the switchgear is finalized."],["What happens after I submit the RFQ?","IndustLabs reviews the information, identifies missing technical items, clarifies project requirements, and follows up with the next steps for pricing, technical review, or scope alignment."]]},"id":"s_1779377683740_ed8bbe9bff915"},{"id":"s_1779389488013_50e8ae2bb9d29","type":"hero","label":"hero","data":{"headline":"Industrial UL 891 Switchgear Infrastructure Built to Last in %STATE%
